[b]v1.1.0 — 45 achievements, Genesis support[/b]
[list]
[*][b]29 new achievements[/b]: famous base-game factions and creatures (Cannibals, Fogmen, Skin Bandits, United Cities, Leviathan, Hive Queen...), 11 for [b]Genesis[/b] (Primordial Hive, MKIV skeletons, Giant, Broodmother, The Wolven Order...) and higher tiers (Myth, Walking Legend, Scrap Yard, Exterminator).
[*]Achievements for content you don't have installed are [b]hidden automatically[/b] (no more 0/5 forever without Genesis).
[*][b]Secret achievements[/b], shown as ??? until unlocked.
[*]Fixed: the F6 panel cut long lists; creatures whose names the game translates oddly (e.g. Leviathan) didn't count; kills saved with translated names in older saves now count too.
[/list]
Existing progress is kept. Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
